// Stormglass Commons Character Appearance H3B.
//
// This read-only look-development composition replaces H3A's shadow-only hair
// and expression bridges with HoloScript's sovereign character-webgpu path.
// HoloScript owns the three neutral civic personas, native @hair styles,
// native procedural-head morph probes, and per-tier hair topology budgets.
// The HoloLand bridge may compile, measure, render, and receipt this source; it
// may not invent a second LOD selector, bind a persona to an adapter family, or
// describe the procedural-head-v1 substrate as a production human face.

composition "Stormglass Character Appearance H3B Native Channels" {
